          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Parlour Caribbean is a multi-vendor e-commerce marketplace for Caribbean artisans selling locally and globally."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I assisted with brand identity development and social graphics for the launch and ongoing channels, supporting a cohesive visual language rooted in community, connection, and Caribbean creativity."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
